{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109004","id":2697333077,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6gxglV","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109004","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109004.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109004.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109004","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109004/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109004/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109004/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bf326793ba564f02af8f8836431818eb68b5eeb2","number":109004,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Editor additions for MipMaps and rd_textures","user":{"login":"DDarby-Lewis","id":37579938,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTc5OTM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37579938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis","html_url":"https://github.com/DDarby-Lewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR adds mipmap selector for texture previews. The mipmap selector only shows if there is at least one mipmap level.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"986\" height=\"571\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c8c6acbb-ee79-4522-8b54-3d57f7a29136\" />\r\n<img width=\"991\" height=\"605\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5550bcb3-9712-4d42-a049-cdaf1e5da591\" />\r\n\r\nIt also enables texture previews for rd_textures. \r\nFinally there is a small addition for rd_textures using RenderingDevice.DATA_FORMAT_R8G8B8A8_UNORM format to properly create their SRGB view - bringing them inline with the same assumptions used by other textures with the R8G8B8A8 format that they will be in SRGB. \r\n\r\nThe project this is being developed for utilises texture generation with compute textures.\r\n\r\nI would also like to consider if it would be possible/reasonable to make the `TexturePreview` class accessible from GDScript so that my procedural texture class could use it without having to write that class into the core engine?\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:* Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12873\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24"